              </span>
              <div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
                  <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-amber-100 text-amber-900">Gold Tier</span>
                  <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">Plus</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-wmcNavy-950 mb-1">₦25,000</h3>
                <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 block mb-6">per calendar month</span>
                
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                  Tailored for mid-level professionals, corporate executives, and business owners building accelerated wealth reserves.
                </p>

                <div class="space-y-3 text-xs mb-8 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">
                  <div class="flex justify-between text-slate-700">
                    <span class="text-slate-500">Regular Savings:</span>
                    <span class="font-bold">₦21,000 / mo</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between text-slate-700">
                    <span class="text-slate-500">Share Capital:</span>
                    <span class="font-bold">₦3,000 (3 units)</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between text-slate-700">
                    <span class="text-slate-500">Mutual Welfare:</span>
                    <span class="font-bold">₦1,000 / mo</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between text-slate-700 pt-2 border-t border-slate-100">
