              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 max-w-3xl mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                Generate, inspect, print, and download publication-grade statutory cooperative statements. Passbook Ledgers feature multi-year audit reconciliation, tripartite accounting (Savings, Shares, Welfare), Inward Remittances (Credits), Outward Disbursements (Debits), and 0% interest loan schedules.
